{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70660","main_id":70660,"main_title":"风行迷踪","main_description":"蒙德城的吉盖克斯似乎正想招募人去试玩某种游戏…","chapter_title":"风行迷踪","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7066002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7066002,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":706600203,"next_line_ids":[706600204],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30051,"speaker_text_hash":407624677,"speaker":"吉盖克斯","speaker_raw":"吉盖克斯","text_hash":3879354906,"text":"啊哈，问得好，「风行迷踪」是一款承载着蒙德城历史的游戏！","raw_text":"啊哈，问得好，「风行迷踪」是一款承载着蒙德城历史的游戏！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7066002.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70660","main_id":70660,"main_title":"风行迷踪","main_description":"蒙德城的吉盖克斯似乎正想招募人去试玩某种游戏…","chapter_title":"风行迷踪","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7066002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7066002,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":706600204,"next_line_ids":[706600205],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30051,"speaker_text_hash":407624677,"speaker":"吉盖克斯","speaker_raw":"吉盖克斯","text_hash":3195294418,"text":"你应该知道，在之前的蒙德城里有一群「贵族」吧？","raw_text":"你应该知道，在之前的蒙德城里有一群「贵族」吧？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7066002.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70660","main_id":70660,"main_title":"风行迷踪","main_description":"蒙德城的吉盖克斯似乎正想招募人去试玩某种游戏…","chapter_title":"风行迷踪","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7066002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7066002,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":706600205,"next_line_ids":[706600206],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30051,"speaker_text_hash":407624677,"speaker":"吉盖克斯","speaker_raw":"吉盖克斯","text_hash":602308250,"text":"他们在蒙德城里暴行不断，让不少人都苦不堪言…","raw_text":"他们在蒙德城里暴行不断，让不少人都苦不堪言…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7066002.json"}
